# Solution A registry-deploy scratch output and runtime address file.
# `tools/deploy_registry.sh` writes a placeholder address to
# contract_address.txt on every run; the compact compiler can leave
# scratch subdirs under circuits/static/wallet-registry/ when invoked
# directly (the script itself uses a temp dir and copies flat files
# `register.{bzkir,prover,verifier,zkir}` into the static directory).
circuits/static/wallet-registry/contract_address.txt
